#
# Default helpers.rc for Xfce's Preferred Applications
#
# Copyright (c) 2005-2006 Benedikt Meurer <benny@xfce.org>
#
# SnapshOT (snapshot-wiki): this file diverts xfce4-helpers' copy, which is kept
# as helpers.rc.distrib. The keys are xfce4-helpers' own. WebBrowser stays
# debian-sensible-browser because xfce4-helpers' firefox helper only knows the
# binaries firefox, firefox-gtk2, firefox-gtk, mozilla-firefox and
# org.mozilla.firefox, not firefox-esr; sensible-browser (sensible-utils, a
# dependency of snapshot-wiki) runs x-www-browser, which firefox-esr provides.
# "exo-open --launch WebBrowser" (the SnapshOT Wiki launcher) reads this file.

WebBrowser=debian-sensible-browser
MailReader=thunderbird
TerminalEmulator=debian-x-terminal-emulator
FileManager=thunar
